1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,000
Duedle for Safari on iPhone: Moodle at Nagoya
Institute of Technology.

2
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:13,600
Open Safari’s extension controls and enable Duedle.

3
00:00:13,600 --> 00:00:23,000
Assignments and quizzes appear together on the
dashboard.

4
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:32,000
Expand “Task settings” to access the list filters.

5
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:41,000
Filter tasks by type and completion status.

6
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:49,000
Filter by deadline or switch to hidden tasks.

7
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:55,000
Tap “Select tasks” to begin a bulk action.

8
00:00:55,000 --> 00:01:03,000
Select cards while scrolling horizontally through
the list.

9
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:08,000
Hide the selected tasks together.

10
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:17,000
Use the display filter to review hidden tasks.

11
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:23,000
Tap “Update tasks” to refresh course and task
information.

12
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:29,000
Progress is shown while information is collected.

13
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:35,000
The completion message confirms the update has
finished.

14
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:43,000
Open Duedle settings to switch the color theme.

15
00:01:43,000 --> 00:01:50,000
Choose the soft-color theme or dark mode.

16
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:57,000
The iOS-style appearance can be toggled
independently.

17
00:01:57,000 --> 00:02:04,000
Open course ordering from the Duedle settings menu.

18
00:02:04,000 --> 00:02:14,000
Use the drag handles to change the course order.

19
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:22,000
Save the order using the button at the bottom.

20
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:32,000
Return to the dashboard to view tasks and courses.

21
00:02:32,000 --> 00:02:40,000
Course pages also show tasks for the current
course.

22
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:45,000
Course pages include section navigation and display
settings.

23
00:02:45,000 --> 00:02:53,000
The help page explains task filters and other
controls.

24
00:02:53,000 --> 00:03:00,000
Illustrations and demo videos show how the controls
work.

25
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:07,000
Open installation instructions for iPhone, iPad and
Mac.

26
00:03:07,000 --> 00:03:14,000
The guide explains enabling Duedle and granting
site access.

27
00:03:14,000 --> 00:03:20,133
Return to Moodle and continue using Duedle.
